## Description

Know someone who needs to get up to speed with Gemma 4? Send them this 2 minute crash course!  With 5 different model sizes (E2B all the way to 31B) and 4 unique architectures, Gemma 4 is a great model for your local use cases. https://t.co/R57VNJeYq4

